            </note>
            <note corresp="#d27-f5" n="5" xml:id="d27-f5-content">
                <p>Nixon approved this recommendation.
                    Underneath Nixon’s approval, Jeanne Davis wrote: “State (S/S—Walsh)
                    notified 5/8, 10:30 am. JWD.”</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
